519
00:28:22,492 --> 00:28:23,493
What?

520
00:28:23,576 --> 00:28:25,829
-Uh...
-When did that happen?

521
00:28:25,912 --> 00:28:27,580
[chuckles] Oh, um...

522
00:28:27,663 --> 00:28:29,374
-[Steven] When did that happen?
-What was that?

523
00:28:29,457 --> 00:28:32,836
That was probably a couple of nights ago.
You were snoozing away,

524
00:28:32,919 --> 00:28:35,005
