to watch Ride Along 2.

525
00:28:35,088 --> 00:28:36,256
-[Gus] That's right.
-[Steven] Remember?

526
00:28:36,339 --> 00:28:39,760
Yeah. Yeah, yeah,
and I just... I got sick from...

527
